    "intro": {
      "zh": "Sega Dreamcast 是世嘉 1998 年发布的 32 位家用游戏机，是首台内置调制解调器的家用主机，以 SH-4 CPU 与 GD-ROM 介质推动 3D 图形与联网游戏的发展。它在技术上极具前瞻性，却因市场环境与竞争格局，成为世嘉的最后一台主机，是游戏机厅「世嘉谢幕」这一叙事的关键锚点。",
      "en": "The Sega Dreamcast, released by Sega in 1998, was a 32-bit home console and the first with a built-in modem, advancing 3D graphics and online gaming with its SH-4 CPU and GD-ROM media. Technologically ahead of its time, it nevertheless became Sega's final console, marking the close of Sega's hardware era."
    },
    "era": 1998,
    "manufacturer": "Sega"
  },
